 add('Frozen exposure','Residual wingspan = wingspan − (4.574910520685837 + 1.0013410045156863 × barefoot height), in inches. The previously validated transformation is reused exactly, without refitting or measurement changes. Inference conditions on this geometry and does not propagate uncertainty in its fitted reference coefficients.')
 add('J1 model','Grouped response **[FTM, FTA−FTM]**, logit(p)=intercept + residual wingspan + barefoot height + original combine position + season. Height is in raw inches. C and 2010–11 are reference levels. Every hybrid remains separate; missing/blank maps to unknown. There are 28 estimable primary coefficients. No player random intercept, latent opportunity factor, FTA predictor, MIN predictor, realized opportunity decomposition or new confounder enters. A fixed ordered basis removes only absent/aliased dummy columns in resamples/subsets; categories are never pooled and exposure/height must remain identifiable. The MLE is unchanged by this basis reduction.')
