 add('Player-cluster bootstrap',f"Exactly 2,000 replicates, PCG64 seed 20260930. Each samples 857 accounting players with replacement and carries all their seasons, including zero rows, into distinct cluster instances. Positive grouped rows are fitted with frozen coding and exposure. No row resampling, residualization refit, silent replacement or outcome-based selection. NumPy linear-interpolation 2.5/97.5 percentiles and SD with ddof=1 were frozen. Failed fits: {b['failed']}; successful fits: {b['successful']}. More than 20 failures would stop interval interpretation. First three replicate sample hashes and coefficients reproduce for both J1 and J2. These bootstrap fractions are empirical resampling summaries, not posterior probabilities.")
